# ~~templates/~~ and ~~static/~~ were excluded here, which silently broke the
# web image: its `COPY . .` produced a container with no templates, so the app
# started and then 500'd on the first page render (INF-011). Every image shares
# this one file because they all build from the repo root, so the two
# directories are now included everywhere; they are a few hundred KB and the
# service images do not notice.
*.pdf
*.md

